<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<Flow xmlns="http://soap.sforce.com/2006/04/metadata">
    <actionCalls>
        <name>SendProviderEmail</name>
        <label>Action: Send Email to Provider</label>
        <locationX>176</locationX>
        <locationY>395</locationY>
        <actionName>emailSimple</actionName>
        <actionType>emailSimple</actionType>
        <connector>
            <targetReference>CreateNotificationTask</targetReference>
        </connector>
        <flowTransactionModel>CurrentTransaction</flowTransactionModel>
        <inputParameters>
            <name>emailAddresses</name>
            <value>
                <elementReference>GetProviderContact.Email</elementReference>
            </value>
        </inputParameters>
        <inputParameters>
            <name>emailSubject</name>
            <value>
                <elementReference>providerEmailSubject</elementReference>
            </value>
        </inputParameters>
        <inputParameters>
            <name>emailBody</name>
            <value>
                <elementReference>providerEmailBody</elementReference>
            </value>
        </inputParameters>
        <nameSegment>emailSimple</nameSegment>
    </actionCalls>
    <apiVersion>49.0</apiVersion>
    <areMetricsLoggedToDataCloud>false</areMetricsLoggedToDataCloud>
    <decisions>
        <name>NoticeAlreadySent</name>
        <label>Decision: Notice Already Sent?</label>
        <locationX>176</locationX>
        <locationY>359</locationY>
        <defaultConnectorLabel>Notice Exists</defaultConnectorLabel>
        <rules>
            <name>NoNoticeYet</name>
            <conditionLogic>and</conditionLogic>
            <conditions>
                <leftValueReference>GetExistingNoticeTask</leftValueReference>
                <operator>IsNull</operator>
                <rightValue>
                    <booleanValue>true</booleanValue>
                </rightValue>
            </conditions>
            <connector>
                <targetReference>SendProviderEmail</targetReference>
            </connector>
            <label>No Notice Yet</label>
        </rules>
    </decisions>
    <decisions>
        <name>ProviderHasEmail</name>
        <label>Decision: Provider Has Email?</label>
        <locationX>176</locationX>
        <locationY>287</locationY>
        <defaultConnectorLabel>No Email</defaultConnectorLabel>
        <rules>
            <name>EmailAvailable</name>
            <conditionLogic>and</conditionLogic>
            <conditions>
                <leftValueReference>GetProviderContact.Email</leftValueReference>
                <operator>IsNull</operator>
                <rightValue>
                    <booleanValue>false</booleanValue>
                </rightValue>
            </conditions>
            <connector>
                <targetReference>GetExistingNoticeTask</targetReference>
            </connector>
            <label>Email Available</label>
        </rules>
    </decisions>
    <decisions>
        <name>RouteAppraisalChange</name>
        <label>Decision: What Changed?</label>
        <locationX>176</locationX>
        <locationY>119</locationY>
        <defaultConnectorLabel>Nothing Relevant</defaultConnectorLabel>
        <rules>
            <name>AcceptedNow</name>
            <conditionLogic>and</conditionLogic>
            <conditions>
                <leftValueReference>$Record.Status</leftValueReference>
                <operator>EqualTo</operator>
                <rightValue>
                    <stringValue>Aceptado</stringValue>
                </rightValue>
            </conditions>
            <conditions>
                <leftValueReference>$Record__Prior.Status</leftValueReference>
                <operator>NotEqualTo</operator>
                <rightValue>
                    <stringValue>Aceptado</stringValue>
                </rightValue>
            </conditions>
            <connector>
                <targetReference>GetAcceptedAppraisal</targetReference>
            </connector>
            <label>Accepted Now</label>
        </rules>
        <rules>
            <name>ProviderAssigned</name>
            <conditionLogic>and</conditionLogic>
            <conditions>
                <leftValueReference>$Record.AppraisedById</leftValueReference>
                <operator>IsNull</operator>
                <rightValue>
                    <booleanValue>false</booleanValue>
                </rightValue>
            </conditions>
            <connector>
                <targetReference>GetProviderContact</targetReference>
            </connector>
            <label>External Provider Assigned</label>
        </rules>
    </decisions>
    <description>All countries. After-save handler for the Appraisal object (used-vehicle trade-in). Current branch: when the appraiser assigned is a Contact (external provider per the business rules; detection by Contact lookup — internal appraisers are Users and end the flow silently), sends the notification email once per opportunity (deduplicated by the traceability task) with the customer intent and logs a task on the related Opportunity for traceability. The notification text is a placeholder until the business provides the final wording. Closure branch: when Status changes to accepted, stamps FinalAppraisalValue into the opportunity trade-in value field (verified 23/07: no native trade-in column exists on Opportunity/Quote in this org); if the reference record is not an Opportunity the update silently matches zero records. Rejection is enforced by the RejectionReasonRequired validation rule. Origin: used-vehicle trade-in appraisal user story (external provider notification).</description>
    <environments>Default</environments>
    <interviewLabel>Appraisal After Handler {!$Flow.CurrentDateTime}</interviewLabel>
    <label>Appraisal After Handler</label>
    <processMetadataValues>
        <name>BuilderType</name>
        <value>
            <stringValue>LightningFlowBuilder</stringValue>
        </value>
    </processMetadataValues>
    <processMetadataValues>
        <name>CanvasMode</name>
        <value>
            <stringValue>AUTO_LAYOUT_CANVAS</stringValue>
        </value>
    </processMetadataValues>
    <processType>AutoLaunchedFlow</processType>
    <recordCreates>
        <name>CreateNotificationTask</name>
        <label>Create Notification Log Task</label>
        <locationX>176</locationX>
        <locationY>503</locationY>
        <inputAssignments>
            <field>Description</field>
            <value>
                <stringValue>Notificación automática enviada al proveedor externo con la intención del cliente de realizar el avalúo del vehículo usado. Trazabilidad del criterio de proveedor externo de la historia de avalúo.</stringValue>
            </value>
        </inputAssignments>
        <inputAssignments>
            <field>OwnerId</field>
            <value>
                <elementReference>$Record.OwnerId</elementReference>
            </value>
        </inputAssignments>
        <inputAssignments>
            <field>Subject</field>
            <value>
                <stringValue>Aviso enviado al proveedor externo del avalúo</stringValue>
            </value>
        </inputAssignments>
        <inputAssignments>
            <field>WhatId</field>
            <value>
                <elementReference>$Record.ReferenceRecordId</elementReference>
            </value>
        </inputAssignments>
        <object>Task</object>
    </recordCreates>
    <recordLookups>
        <name>GetAcceptedAppraisal</name>
        <label>Get Records: Get Accepted Appraisal</label>
        <locationX>396</locationX>
        <locationY>179</locationY>
        <assignNullValuesIfNoRecordsFound>false</assignNullValuesIfNoRecordsFound>
        <connector>
            <targetReference>UpdateOpportunityTradeIn</targetReference>
        </connector>
        <filterLogic>and</filterLogic>
        <filters>
            <field>Id</field>
            <operator>EqualTo</operator>
            <value>
                <elementReference>$Record.Id</elementReference>
            </value>
        </filters>
        <getFirstRecordOnly>true</getFirstRecordOnly>
        <object>Appraisal</object>
        <storeOutputAutomatically>true</storeOutputAutomatically>
    </recordLookups>
    <recordLookups>
        <name>GetExistingNoticeTask</name>
        <label>Get Records: Get Existing Notice</label>
        <locationX>176</locationX>
        <locationY>323</locationY>
        <assignNullValuesIfNoRecordsFound>false</assignNullValuesIfNoRecordsFound>
        <connector>
            <targetReference>NoticeAlreadySent</targetReference>
        </connector>
        <filterLogic>and</filterLogic>
        <filters>
            <field>WhatId</field>
            <operator>EqualTo</operator>
            <value>
                <elementReference>$Record.ReferenceRecordId</elementReference>
            </value>
        </filters>
        <filters>
            <field>Subject</field>
            <operator>EqualTo</operator>
            <value>
                <stringValue>Aviso enviado al proveedor externo del avalúo</stringValue>
            </value>
        </filters>
        <getFirstRecordOnly>true</getFirstRecordOnly>
        <object>Task</object>
        <storeOutputAutomatically>true</storeOutputAutomatically>
    </recordLookups>
    <recordLookups>
        <name>GetProviderContact</name>
        <label>Get Records: Get Provider Contact</label>
        <locationX>176</locationX>
        <locationY>179</locationY>
        <assignNullValuesIfNoRecordsFound>false</assignNullValuesIfNoRecordsFound>
        <connector>
            <targetReference>ProviderHasEmail</targetReference>
        </connector>
        <filterLogic>and</filterLogic>
        <filters>
            <field>Id</field>
            <operator>EqualTo</operator>
            <value>
                <elementReference>$Record.AppraisedById</elementReference>
            </value>
        </filters>
        <getFirstRecordOnly>true</getFirstRecordOnly>
        <object>Contact</object>
        <storeOutputAutomatically>true</storeOutputAutomatically>
    </recordLookups>
    <recordUpdates>
        <name>UpdateOpportunityTradeIn</name>
        <label>Set Trade-In Value on Opportunity</label>
        <locationX>396</locationX>
        <locationY>239</locationY>
        <filterLogic>and</filterLogic>
        <filters>
            <field>Id</field>
            <operator>EqualTo</operator>
            <value>
                <elementReference>$Record.ReferenceRecordId</elementReference>
            </value>
        </filters>
        <inputAssignments>
            <field>TradeInValue__c</field>
            <value>
                <elementReference>GetAcceptedAppraisal.FinalAppraisalValue</elementReference>
            </value>
        </inputAssignments>
        <object>Opportunity</object>
    </recordUpdates>
    <start>
        <locationX>50</locationX>
        <locationY>0</locationY>
        <connector>
            <targetReference>RouteAppraisalChange</targetReference>
        </connector>
        <object>Appraisal</object>
        <recordTriggerType>CreateAndUpdate</recordTriggerType>
        <triggerType>RecordAfterSave</triggerType>
    </start>
    <status>Active</status>
    <textTemplates>
        <name>providerEmailBody</name>
        <isViewedAsPlainText>true</isViewedAsPlainText>
        <text>Estimado proveedor,

Le informamos que un cliente tiene la intención de realizar el avalúo de su vehículo usado como parte de una negociación de compra.

Vigencia de la solicitud: {!$Record.ValidityEndDate}

Por favor coordine la cita con la sucursal correspondiente.

[TEXTO PROVISORIO — reemplazar con la redacción oficial del negocio al llegar el insumo]

GrupoQ</text>
    </textTemplates>
    <textTemplates>
        <name>providerEmailSubject</name>
        <isViewedAsPlainText>true</isViewedAsPlainText>
        <text>Solicitud de avalúo de vehículo usado — GrupoQ</text>
    </textTemplates>
</Flow>
